{
 "section": "PROTECTED_MODEL.md 18.4.7.1",
 "note": "Test keys only, made by protected40.py from fixed labels (stream(label, n): SHA-256 of the label and a 32-bit little-endian counter, concatenated). No SDK trusts them.",
 "rule": "an attempt ends as a lease, a stop, refused (a 4xx other than 429 whose body is JSON with an error string, after 18.4.10's retries inside the attempt) or unreachable (anything else: no answer, a stall, no outcome within 10 s, a 5xx, a 429, a redirect, a 4xx that is not the API's, a 2xx that is not a lease the Core accepts). Per lease, kept in the sealed state: unreachable and refused, both cleared by a lease accepted. The Core's clock is 18.4.7's (clock.json). valid while now < exp; grace while exp <= now < exp + 86400 and an attempt ended unreachable and none refused since the lease; else needs_connection; stopped after a verified stop. until = exp + 86400 while a lease is held",
 "grace_s": 86400,
 "attempt_wait_s": 10,
 "answers_are": "{route, answer: none | stalled | late} for no answer (none at all; one that began and stalled; none within attempt_wait_s), else {route, status, body: json | html | empty, error: the JSON body's error string or null, reason: its stop reason or null, core: accepted or refused for a 2xx lease answer, stop for a signed stop the Core verified, else null}. route: token, challenge, attest, model-key",
